  dialogueLines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e1dba4a0bb0e4fa9172311b0e912f, type: 2}
    text: Congrats of your win, Ebi!
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e1dba4a0bb0e4fa9172311b0e912f, type: 2}
    text: Your uncle would be proud.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e1dba4a0bb0e4fa9172311b0e912f, type: 2}
    text: ...Your brother too.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e1dba4a0bb0e4fa9172311b0e912f, type: 2}
    text: Lets get back on topic. Congrats for your first win! just four more to
      go until the number one spot is yours.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 914e1dba4a0bb0e4fa9172311b0e912f, type: 2}
    text: Well, get on with it. Off you go.
